    "Substrate identity (e.g., casein per CHEMBL4815728 vs. a peptide substrate) is unresolved and can shift apparent IC50.",
    "If ATP is not at Km, reported IC50 will not be comparable to ATP-competitive literature values; mechanism (competitive vs allosteric) is not determinable from a single ATP concentration.",
